# Conversation Recovery Platform (FROZEN BOUNDARY)

Conversation Recovery is **platform infrastructure** around the frozen AI Counseling Engine (Phases 1–14).

## Never

- Edit files under `services/chatbot/careerCounselling/**` for recovery, follow-up, or resume behavior
- Restart journeys from Phase 1 in recovery messages
- Include booking URLs in recovery copy (Phase 13 owns booking CTAs)
- Reuse WhatsApp Ops “manual recovery” for inactive counseling journeys

## Always

- Persist / restore via `ConversationRecoverySnapshot` + `conversationRecoveryResumeService`
- Write snapshots only from guided-flow counselling turns (`guidedFlowProcessors.js`)
- Resume hydrate **before** bot-state TTL wipe in the orchestrator
- Keep admin UI at `/admin/conversation-recovery` (separate from WhatsApp Ops DLR recovery)

## Freeze rule

Do **not** edit Phase 1–14 engines for recovery, follow-up, or resume behavior.

**Version:** Conversation Recovery & Follow-up Engine **v1.0.0** (Production Ready).

## Regression

- `node scripts/conversationRecoveryCertification.js`
- `node scripts/phase1to14Regression.js` when proving engines untouched
- Ops surfaces: health, alerts, audit, bulk, timeline, campaign performance, message preview
